```spl
* ============================================================================
* A01 - Tag out of operating envelope
* Read-only. Schedule every 5m over a 15m window (adjust to sample rate).
* Data model: docs/data-model.md
* ============================================================================

index=ot_historian sourcetype=historian:snapshot quality=Good
    tag IN ("PLANT1.*.PV")

* Attach the per-tag, per-mode baseline
| lookup ot_baseline.csv tag mode OUTPUT p01 p99 ll hl mean std

* Engineering limits win over statistical bands when present
| eval lower = coalesce(ll, p01)
| eval upper = coalesce(hl, p99)

* Flag in-band vs out-of-band
| eval in_band = if(value >= lower AND value <= upper, 1, 0)

* Persistence: count consecutive out-of-band samples per tag, reset on any in-band sample
| sort 0 tag _time
| streamstats reset_before="(in_band==1)" count as breach_run by tag

* Alert only when the excursion has persisted (dwell >= 3 samples)
| where in_band==0 AND breach_run>=3

* Enrich for the analyst
| eval breach = if(value < lower, "below", "above")
| eval sigma_off = round((value - mean) / std, 2)
| eval detection="A01", severity=case(sigma_off>6 OR sigma_off< -6,"high", true(),"medium")

| table _time tag mode value lower upper breach sigma_off severity detection
| sort - _time
```
